    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>Tsuchi possess a deep connection to the grounding forces of the earth. They are usually craftsman and engineers.</p>\n<p>You have a +2 racial bonus to all Crafting and Create checks. Furthermore, you have advantage on checks and saving throws to avoid being knocked prone or moved against your will.</p>\n<p><em>Language:</em> Gaian, the heritage's language (Graham's ruling). <em>Element:</em> Earth (acid). <em>Applied automatically:</em> a +2 racial bonus to Crafting, and to Create checks made with any other skill. Advantage is <em>offered</em> on your own checks and saves to avoid being knocked prone or moved against your will; tick it when the roll is one. <em>Applied automatically:</em> a Shove or Trip against you is rolled at disadvantage, because you roll nothing against it (Graham's ruling of 21 October 2026); the attacker's card says so.</p>",
